{
  "id": 8860499247303,
  "title": "Custom Fiery Soccer Ball, Custom Name Comforter Set, Machin - Design 5",
  "handle": "custom-fiery-soccer-ball-custom-name-comforter-set-machin-design-5",
  "body_html": "<p>Inspire your young athlete with this Jeminise Soccer Player Comforter Set, designed to bring the excitement of the game into any boy's room. This custom bedding set allows for personalization with a name and number, making it a unique and cherished item for any soccer fan.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Soccer Enthusiasm:</strong> Ideal for young soccer enthusiasts, inspiring them to chase their dreams and celebrate their love for the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with a name and number to create a unique and special bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Features a hidden zipper and a smooth metal pull for effortless duvet insertion and removal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Environmentally friendly finishing process ensures fabric retains dye and prevents fading, with smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried without heat, ensuring quick drying and fluffier results.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover, with 2 pillowcases and 2 shams (quantity subject to size).</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Soccer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>A4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Full</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Width</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Sham Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
